OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fbreezy at times tonight with outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain, with rain perhaps turning
OL,8,Fmore showery later in the night.
OL,9,FBecoming chilly, with a localised
OL,10,Frural frost possible across western
OL,11,Fparts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FEarly cloud and rain soon
OL,14,Fclearing to give sunny spells through
OL,15,Fthe morning, although a few coastal
OL,16,Fshowers still possible. Becoming
OL,17,Fcloudy later with rain arriving into
OL,18,Fthe evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
